(976, 2, '', 'Front Page', 'pets3', 1, 10625, 1, 1, '1', '1', '0', '0', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, '<center><img src = https://hubbly.pw/uploads/Catalog_Frame7.png></center><b><center>Hubbly Catalog v4.5.0</center></b>Hubbly prides itself on having the most up-to-date catalog around. If you discover that we are missing a furniture, please reach out to our team!<br><br><b>This is the original version of Hubbly catalog - created  by Puffin.</b>', '', 0, ''),
