(96, 25, '', 'Badges', 'pets3', 1, 36500, 1, -1, '1', '1', '0', '0', '', '', '', '', NULL, '<center><img src = /swf/c_images/catalogue/39IH9mHr8ngS7X9.gif></center><b><center>Hubbly Catalog v4.5.0</center></b>Hubbly prides itself on having the most up-to-date catalog around. If you discover that we are missing a furniture, please reach out to our Discord suggestions channel and we\'ll add it right away!<br><br><b> The original Hubbly Catalog - created and maintained by Puffin</b>', NULL, 0, ''),
(1745, 89, '', 'Introduction', 'pets3', 1, 3024, 1, 0, '1', '1', '0', '0', '', '', '', '', NULL, '<h2><img src =\"https://hubbly.pw/uploads/market.png\" align=right </a>Rare Values</h2><font size=\"2\">Our system tracks sales made via Marketplace to provide users with the most accurate, and up-to-date information. Sale prices are averaged out to determine approximate value, and the Marketplace page on the website displays vital sales information in an easy-to-understand visual graph to give you a better feel for its history.<br> <br>Clicking on any item in the Rare Values interface in-game will bring up a list of users who own that specific item, how many they own, as well inactive items on staff accounts so make hunting your favourite items much easier!</font><hr><h2><img src =\"https://hubbly.pw/uploads/Credz.png\" align=right </a> Credits</h2><font size=\"2\">Credits are easily earned by completing tasks in your <b><i>Event Journal</i></b>, accepting your drop-downs every 15 minutes, or by staying online.<br><br>Online activity is rewarded every 30 minutes with 250 Credits and 1 Diamond. This number is increased depending on which VIP Tier you hold. You can find out more information about our VIP Packages by clicking <a href=\"/shop\" target=\"blank\">here</a></font><hr><h2><img src =\"https://hubbly.pw/uploads/Diadz.png\" align=right </a>Diamonds</h2><font size=\"2\">Diamonds are primarily earned through activity, completing achievements, playing <b><i>Automatic Games</i></b> in The Hub, as well as commpleting certain tasks in your <b><i>Event Journal</i></b>.<br><br>Depending on the complexity of the auto-game, the Credit & Diamond payouts will match... plus- it qualifies you to win the GOTW Prize, which is even more Diamonds and Credits :D</font><hr><h2><img src=\"/uploads/pokerchips.png\" align=\"right\">Poker Chips</b></h2>Purchaseable via Credits, and taxed in Diamonds, Poker Chips provide you an new opportunity to grow your wealth, and collect the kind of rares you want!<br><br>The intention of the Poker Shop is to keep currency actively moving, and getting rooms built so credits and diamonds don\'t just sit and collect dust on your account, which can generally result in a decreased value of currency. These rares are charged at a slightly premium price for the convenience.', NULL, 0, ''),
