(564, 952, '', 'Christmas Hub', 'default_3x3', 1, 42, 11, 7, '1', '1', '0', '0', '', 'hubbly_h', '', '', '', '<h2>Poker Chips</b></h2><img src=\"/uploads/pokerchips.png\" align=\"right\">Purchaseable via Diamonds, and taxed in Credits, Poker Chips provide you an new opportunity to grow your wealth, and afford the kind of rooms you want to build! <br><br><hr><img src=\"/uploads/dicerchips.png\" align=\"right\"><h2>Gambling & Trading</h2>True to its namesake, Poker Chips make for the perfect currency to gamble or trade amongst other players within the community. Simply trade, or use your pay commands to get started!<br><hr><h2>Exchange</h2> As a premier currency, your Poker Chips can also  be traded in for an assortment of Classic Rares, Custom Rares, and other unlockable items. Simply double click your Poker Chip exchange furniture, or use the :redeem command while they are placed in your inventory to start buying today!', NULL, 0, ''),
