(1177, 1174, 'events_bopper', 'Bopper', 'pets3', 1, 80, 1, 4, '1', '1', '0', '0', '', '', '', '', NULL, '<p><strong><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"../../../../assets/img/wired.png\"></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>TRIGGERS:</strong><br><img src=\"../../../../uploads/newbopper.png\" width=\"97\" height=\"134\" align=\"right\"> x1 WIRED Trigger: Repeat Effect<br><br><strong>EFFECTS:</strong><br>x1 WIRED Trigger: Quick Bopper<br><br><strong>ADD-ONS (Optional):</strong><br>x1 WIRED Add-on: Cancel Move Animation<br><br><strong>OTHER:<br></strong>x1 Furni of Choice for Bopper<br><br><strong>STEP 1:</strong><br>Place down your&nbsp;<strong>WIRED Trigger: Repeat Effect </strong>and your <strong>WIRED Effect: Quick Bopper </strong>on top of eachother.<Br><br>You may optionally add <strong>WIRED Add-on</strong><strong>: Cancel Move Animation </strong>on top of this stack if you wish to hide any animations when the item is moved. This is entirely optional and up to your own personal preference. &nbsp;<br><br><strong>STEP 2:</strong><br>You may leave the&nbsp;<strong>WIRED Trigger: Repeat Effect&nbsp;</strong>at 0.5 seconds;<br><br>- Double click on your&nbsp;<strong>WIRED Effect: Quick Bopper</strong> and under <em>Bopper Furni</em>, press \"Select Item\" and choose your item you want to use as your bopper. Press finish; <br><br> <i>*the posistion of the item in the room when it is selected will determine where it returns to once it has bopped a user.</i><br><br>- Under&nbsp;<em>Teleportation Furni,</em> press \"Select Items\" and choose the furniture you\'d like the user who is bopped to teleport to. Press finish &amp; save the Wired.<br><br></p>\r\n<p>Congratulations! You\'ve just Wired one of the simplest Wired Bopper\'s you\'ll ever have the pleasure of doing! Be sure to test your Wired by moving the item beside a user to see if the desired results are achieved.</p>', NULL, 0, ''),
