(1196, 894, 'clothing_shop', 'Clothing Store', 'pets3', 1, 244710, 1, 0, '1', '1', '0', '0', '', '', '', '', NULL, '<b><h2>Hubbly Clothing Shop</h2></b><img src=\"/uploads/buyables.png\" align=\"right\">Step into style- whether you\'re rocking a legendary hair cut, repping your house with wizarding robes, or making a bold statement with limited-edition and seasonal clothing, our catalog has everything you need to turn your avatar into an absolute  icon! <br><br><br><br> <center><i>Mix, match, and express yourself like never before- your next favorite outfit is just a click away!</i> </center><hr><b><h2>Limited Edition Clothing</h2></b>Limited Edition clothing isn’t just stylish- it’s an investment. As these rare items vanish from circulation over time, their value rises, making them prized possessions for collectors and traders alike. Own a piece of Hubbly history before it’s gone for good!<hr><b><h2>Seasonal Clothing</h2></b>Seasonal clothing brings flair and exclusivity that shifts with the calendar- think spooky fits for Halloween or cozy winter wear. Their availability is fleeting, and as the season fades, demand and trade value often soar. Smart collectors know: timing is everything.', NULL, 0, ''),
